inh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/2e/98/df/cea8a6103b8b5a76e5efed772509224b.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/2e/98/df/cea8a6103b8b5a76e5efed772509224b.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/2e/98/df/cea8a6103b8b5a76e5efed772509224b.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2e/98/df/cea8a6103b8b5a76e5efed772509224b.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2e/98/df/cea8a6103b8b5a76e5efed772509224b.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/bf/e3/79/fa7940a48fd6eb6b0aec0c49562292aa.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/bf/e3/79/fa7940a48fd6eb6b0aec0c49562292aa.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/bf/e3/79/fa7940a48fd6eb6b0aec0c49562292aa.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/bf/e3/79/fa7940a48fd6eb6b0aec0c49562292aa.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/bf/e3/79/fa7940a48fd6eb6b0aec0c49562292aa.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/39/a9/b3/b962406957797e3a763a249069aaecc6.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/39/a9/b3/b962406957797e3a763a249069aaecc6.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/39/a9/b3/b962406957797e3a763a249069aaecc6.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/39/a9/b3/b962406957797e3a763a249069aaecc6.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/39/a9/b3/b962406957797e3a763a249069aaecc6.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/82/f5/6c/f4c478841f3cc52e9dc870